essbook><name>KAJITA KUNIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAJITA, KUNIYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAJITA KUNIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAJITA, KUNIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An antenna controller is provided in which an antenna receives a radio signal, a level detector detects the level of the received signal, and a control section controls a driver section to achieve an optimal antenna length corresponding to the results of detection. The antenna controller automatically expands or contracts the antenna so that it may have an optimal antenna length without a manual operation.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On décrit un dispositif de commande d'antenne dans lequel l'antenne reçoit un signal radio, un détecteur de niveau détecte le niveau du signal reçu et une partie de commande active une partie étage pilote pour obtenir une longueur d'antenne optimale correspondant aux résultats de la détection. Le dispositif de commande d'antenne allonge ou raccourci automatiquement l'antenne pour obtenir une longueur d'antenne optimale sans intervention manuelle.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all